stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ActiveSession: SessionStart (inject checkpoint if present)

    state ActiveSession {
        [*] --> WarmCache: Turn frequency < 5 min (0.1x cache read)
        WarmCache --> WarmCache: Execute turn (quiet output -q)
        WarmCache --> ColdCacheWarning: Idle > 15-30 min (prompt cache expired)
        ColdCacheWarning --> CheckpointRequired: Nudge triggered by hook
    }

    ActiveSession --> ContextWarning: Steps >= 50 OR Context >= 70%
    
    state ContextWarning {
        [*] --> CheckpointCreation: Write docs/CHECKPOINT.md
        CheckpointCreation --> Verification: Zero-context read check
    }

    ContextWarning --> CompactHarness: Claude Code (/compact)
    ContextWarning --> ResetHarness: Antigravity agy (fresh session)

    CompactHarness --> ActiveSession: SessionStart (in-place resume)
    ResetHarness --> ActiveSession: SessionStart (load newest checkpoint)
